# Visium/Figure/Paper_info: of the officially distributed material, only Source_Data is tracked (manuscript, Figure PDFs/PPTX, etc. are excluded)
Visium/Figure/Paper_info/Paper_info/*
!Visium/Figure/Paper_info/Paper_info/Source_Data/
